    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Orbitron is  sci-fi TACTIC ARCADE  combines tactical thinking with arcade skills. It offers an heroic space chess mode and RT orbi  mode with upgrades and items for ships, along with experienced commanders and crews.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This game base on new type of space heroic &quot;CHESS&quot;. Getting control of the spacefield won\u2019t be so easy! You\u2019ll need to win in real-time battle where, but as the attacker, you\u2019ll have a significant advantage. When you use it. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a SOLO game dev project. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">=========================================== </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience intense, turn-based battles on the space board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in arcade-style fights with upgradable battle ships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead experienced crews and skilled commanders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover and combine advanced technologies to gain an edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built on the ELO ranking system.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">===========================================  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick access to the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short battle around 15-60min</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infinite gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No added monetization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No user data mining.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playtest opening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">===========================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enjoy the battles. :)</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Orbitron is  sci-fi TACTIC ARCADE  combines tactical thinking with arcade skills. It offers an heroic space chess mode and RT orbi  mode with upgrades and items for ships, along with experienced commanders and crews.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This game base on new type of space heroic &quot;CHESS&quot;. Getting control of the spacefield won\u2019t be so easy! You\u2019ll need to win in real-time battle where, but as the attacker, you\u2019ll have a significant advantage. When you use it. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a SOLO game dev project. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">=========================================== </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience intense, turn-based battles on the space board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in arcade-style fights with upgradable battle ships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead experienced crews and skilled commanders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover and combine advanced technologies to gain an edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built on the ELO ranking system.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">===========================================  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick access to the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short battle around 15-60min</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infinite gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No added monetization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No user data mining.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playtest opening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">===========================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enjoy the battles. :)</strong></p>",
